**/.git
contrib/
# Cross.toml builds contrib/cross/Dockerfile.* with the repo root as context.
!contrib/cross/
docs/
localnet/
scripts/
target/

# Nothing below is tracked in this repo. The patterns exist so a developer's
# local credentials cannot be swept into the build context by `COPY . .` and
# baked into a layer (or a shared buildcache) that later gets pushed to GHCR.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.age
**/signing.share
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/
**/.kube/
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/secrets/
**/*secret*.y*ml
